/// Module "task" — run guest functions on their own FreeRTOS tasks.
/// Each spawned task gets its own WAMR exec env; tasks run to completion and
/// clean themselves up (there is deliberately no task-delete: killing a task
/// mid-execution would leak host resources). At most 8 tasks may be live.
/// Errors: 0 = ok, negative = error (see bindings/README.md).
interface task {
  /// Run the guest function at table-idx (no parameters) on a new task.
  /// stack-size in bytes (2048..65536); priority 0..24; core 0, 1, or -1
  /// for no affinity.
  task-spawn: func(table-idx: u32, name: string, stack-size: s32, priority: s32, core: s32) -> s32;
}
